<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He speaks, and by His word is giv’n</l><l>His peace, a blessed gift of heav’n;</l><l>Not as the world He peace doth give,</l><l>’Tis through this hope my soul shall live.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I live; not I; ’tis He alone</l><l>By whom the mighty work is done;</l><l>Dead to myself, alive to Him,</l><l>I count all loss His rest to gain.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now rest, my heart, the work is done,</l><l>I’m saved through the Eternal Son;</l><l>Let all my pow’rs my soul employ,</l><l>To tell the world my peace and joy.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
